{"3793800":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Pulse Drive","steam_appid":3793800,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4931570,5265740],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tap  to the beat to build  speed!<\/strong><br><strong>PULSE DRIVE<\/strong> is an arcade racing game  where you accelerate by steering to the beat of the music.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.poster.avif?t=1793744447\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.webm?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.mp4?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a futuristic hover vehicle, powered by musical beats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tracks across 6 campaigns in ascending difficulty.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, jump, fall or glide across hand crafted dreamlike environments.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for medals, or compete on the leaderboards against friends.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own tracks and share them with others on the Steam Workshop.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.poster.avif?t=1793744447\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.webm?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.mp4?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer posts regular updates on <strong>Discord<\/strong> - feel free to join and chat!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.poster.avif?t=1793744447\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.webm?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.mp4?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tap  to the beat to build  speed!<\/strong><br><strong>PULSE DRIVE<\/strong> is an arcade racing game  where you accelerate by steering to the beat of the music.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.poster.avif?t=1793744447\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.webm?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c2099907eb99183f0e3095a66e4dd54c.mp4?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a futuristic hover vehicle, powered by musical beats.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete tracks across 6 campaigns in ascending difficulty.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, jump, fall or glide across hand crafted dreamlike environments.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for medals, or compete on the leaderboards against friends.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own tracks and share them with others on the Steam Workshop.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.poster.avif?t=1793744447\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.webm?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/ffacf6723bcb4dffc0748e094cfa4b2f.mp4?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer posts regular updates on <strong>Discord<\/strong> - feel free to join and chat!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.poster.avif?t=1793744447\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.webm?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/extras\/c60746c047dc8178ffc2d9ab2722cd50.mp4?t=1793744447\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"Tap to the beat to build speed! Pulse Drive is an arcade racer with a rhythm element. Casually enjoy a ride through original dreamlike environments, challenge yourself to complete all the tracks, or challenge your friends on the leaderboards!","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Dutch","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/78dac9676b34ff9a66dc7aa5993e56fcf15a60b1\/header.jpg?t=1793744447","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/a00b7846f8e3ad6dd5b695ed170f1735d6295406\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793744447","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3793800\/a00b7846f8e3ad6dd5b695ed170f1735d6295406\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793744447","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/SteamOS<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4690K \/ AMD Ryzen5 1500X<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon RX 470<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 3 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/